    "description": "Tournierjc TensorFold fork 53ceb126 with the exact turboderp EXL3 6.05bpw checkpoint declared by the kit. Text only: this exact checkpoint revision has no published vision sidecar, despite the kit documenting the optional conversion path. One stream and explicit disk-backed PLE tables reduce memory pressure for the 6.05bpw checkpoint. INT8 KV, MTP and the creator\u2019s EXL3 kernels. Memory is an estimate, not a measured qualification; physical Spark execution remains untested here.",
